<title>BRAZIL: Brazil March 7 coffee regs 2.56 mln bags March-May.</title>
<headline>Brazil March 7 coffee regs 2.56 mln bags March-May.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil coffee export registrations as of March 7 totaled 2.56 million bags for March, April and May, according to the March 18 bulletin of the Rio de Janeiro Coffee Center.</p>
<p>A breakdown by month was as follows.</p>
<p> MONTH     REGISTRATIONS IN 60-KG BAGS</p>
<p> March		  1,530,153</p>
<p> April		    675,479</p>
<p> May			358,584</p>
<p> TOTAL		  2,564 216</p>
<p>--Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
